<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AlMasterclass - Build Wealth Without Losing Your Soul</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 20px;
            color: white;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.5em;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }

        .cta-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: white;
            color: #764ba2;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: white;
            border: 2px solid white;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .features {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 60px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 3em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            color: #764ba2;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 1.5em;
        }

        .stats {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 60px auto;
            padding: 40px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #764ba2;
        }

        .stat-label {
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2em;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 1.2em;
            }

            .cta-buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Build Wealth Without Losing Your Soul</h1>
        <p>Join 2,000+ Muslims learning to create success the halal way</p>

        <div class="cta-buttons">
            <% if (user) { %>
                <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary">Go to Dashboard</a>
            <% } else { %>
                <a href="/join" class="btn btn-primary">Start Free</a>
                <a href="/login" class="btn btn-secondary">Login</a>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="features">
        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">🎓</div>
            <h3>World-Class Training</h3>
            <p>Learn from proven strategies that generated $10M+ in sales</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">💰</div>
            <h3>Earn As You Learn</h3>
            <p>Share your affiliate link and earn 30% recurring commissions for life</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">🤝</div>
            <h3>Strong Community</h3>
            <p>Connect with thousands of Muslim entrepreneurs building wealth together</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">🕌</div>
            <h3>Faith-Centered</h3>
            <p>Build success without compromising your Islamic values</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">🚀</div>
            <h3>Proven Methods</h3>
            <p>Battle-tested strategies from someone who went from eviction to empire</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">🌍</div>
            <h3>Global Impact</h3>
            <p>Join students from 40+ countries making a difference</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stats">
        <div>
            <div class="stat-number">$10M+</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Generated in Sales</div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="stat-number">2,000+</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Students</div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="stat-number">30+</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Water Wells Built</div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="stat-number">40+</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Countries</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
